	<xs:simpleType name="ReplyCodeType">
		<xs:annotation>
			<xs:documentation xml:lang="en">Leaflet 918 element 63 -- The code gives the reason for the negative reply. </xs:documentation>
			<xs:documentation xml:lang="en"> 
			1 - Syntax error: general reply with erroneous coding or erroneous construction of request.
			10 - 	Reservation blocked: the reservation equipment is not attainable in the logic sense.
			20 - Request cannot be processed because there is no provision for: - the type of request (e.g. adjacent place, specific place) or - the type of service (e.g. partial cancellation, exchange) or - the service (e.g. ferry, mealtime, tax at station) or - a reservation in more than one compartment or in more than one type of berth.
			30 - Erroneous cancellation data (reference number, train, date, number of places), or cancellation already carried out.
			31 - Incompatibility of the place designations when specific or adjacent places are requested.
			32 - Train category and tariff details incompatible.
			33 - Erroneous cancellation data (reference number, train, date, number of places).
			34 -	Already cancelled.
			40 - Beginning of allocation time or closing of booking period not observed.
			50 - Train cannot be reserved on the sector requested and/or on the day requested.
			51 - train temporarily not bookable
			52 - unknown station code in origin or destination station
			60 - Service in the train requested or in the reservation sector requested not available on the day requested.
			61 -	Service (e.g. couchette coach) and requested reservation sector not compatible on the day requested (61 should not be used in future implementations).
			70 -	Request for "definitely smoking" or "definitely non-smoking" cannot be met.
			71 -	Compartment request cannot be met.
			72 -	Request for a specific seat position cannot be met.
			73 -	Special offer/quota not available.
			74 -   Requested separate or mixed gender allocation not possible
			75 -   Individual ticketing for this request cannot be met.
			80 -	Service on the requested travel day, train and requested route sold out
			81 -	Not possible to accommodate together; divide reservation request.
			82 - Service class not available.
			83 -	Invalid tariff combination.
			84 -	Cancellation not permitted.
			85 -	Partial cancellation not permitted.
			86 -	Tariff requested no longer available.
			87 -	Tariff not valid for number of people or service.
			88 -	Tariff code necessary for train.
			100 -	Allocation possible; addition to negative partial replies to a combined request.
			110 - Reservation temporarily not possible; allocation from the requested place allocation temporarily not possible for operating or data-processing reasons.
			111 - Reservation not possible; electronic allocation from the requested place allocation will not be possible for operating  or data-processing reasons for a considerable time.
			120 - Cancellation message: processing not possible.
			200 - Request not permitted an account of the conditions of sale.		
            201 - Request does not correspond to the definition of the product.
            202 - Refund not possible for this product.			
			</xs:documentation>
		</xs:annotation>
		<xs:restriction base="xs:integer">
			<xs:minInclusive value="0"/>
			<xs:maxInclusive value="999"/>
		</xs:restriction>
	</xs:simpleType>
