					1 - Motor vehicle less than 3,81 m in length and with a roof width up to 1,35 m.
					2 - Motor vehicle between 3,81 m up to 4,42 m in length and with a roof width up to 1,35 m
					3 - Motor vehicle or boat between 4,42 m up to 5,30 m in length and with a roof width up to 1,35 m
					4 - Motorcycle
					5 - Motorcycle and sidecar
					6 - Motor vehicle less than 3,81 m in length and with a roof width between 1,36 m and 1,55 m
					7 - Motor vehicle between 3,81 m and 4,42 m in length and with a roof width between 1,36 m and 1,55 m
					8 - Motor vehicle or boat between 4,42 m up to 5,30 m in length and with a roof width between 1,36 m and 1,55 m
					</xs:documentation>
